    {
      "name": "places/ChIJQwZhB7WMaS4RcQ6gRHh6M1c/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNqanRXTTZ3RRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 years ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Orders made one day in advance were still well-served. The custom cakes were very detailed. The cakes tasted delicious. For such a high-quality and large cake, I think the price is quite reasonable. I hope the shop continues to grow rapidly. Thank you for making my son's birthday so festive.",
        "languageCode": "en-US"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Order H-1 tetep dilayanin dengan baik. Hasil custom kue sangat detail. Rasa kue enak. Untuk kualitas dan kue tinggi besar gitu harga segitu murah menurut saya. Semoga toko nya dapat berkembang pesat. Terima kasih ultah anak saya jadi meriah.",
        "languageCode": "id"
      },
